            }
        },
        "cfaf19f4-5fc9-4f09-8d88-66529c39d151": {
            "name": "Text",
            "value": {
                "data": "<p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"31929ecc-d743-4439-9707-44b8269cb87e\" data-label=\"Jay\" data-type=\"component\">Jay<\/span> : This is testing text.<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"0c850ecd-835f-45ec-902e-ac4ad1ad0256\" data-label=\"Iye\" data-type=\"component\">Iye<\/span> : This one is really long and probably goes off the screen if we don't have text wrapping or formatting or anything like that. Also it will take some time to print out once we're going one character at a time. Characters as in letters in a word though, not characters like us!<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"31929ecc-d743-4439-9707-44b8269cb87e\" data-label=\"Jay\" data-type=\"component\">Jay<\/span> : Wow, you said a lot!<\/p>",
                "type": "string"
            },
            "cType": "components",
            "cId": "fa692c77-8520-4584-b716-b4a9f9ce0103"
        },
        "b80f5d08-7f65-4324-8bcb-f2ba1fdba92b": {
            "name": "Text",
            "value": {
                "data": "<p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"0c850ecd-835f-45ec-902e-ac4ad1ad0256\" data-label=\"Iye\" data-type=\"component\">Iye<\/span> : Hey, they kick you out of tag again?<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"31929ecc-d743-4439-9707-44b8269cb87e\" data-label=\"Jay\" data-type=\"component\">Jay<\/span> : No, I left! They won't listen to me about the humans.<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"0c850ecd-835f-45ec-902e-ac4ad1ad0256\" data-label=\"Iye\" data-type=\"component\">Iye<\/span> : Maybe it's because they're just trying to have fun?<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"31929ecc-d743-4439-9707-44b8269cb87e\" data-label=\"Jay\" data-type=\"component\">Jay<\/span> : How can they run around having fun when at any moment a human could come in here and take one of us away?!<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"0c850ecd-835f-45ec-902e-ac4ad1ad0256\" data-label=\"Iye\" data-type=\"component\">Iye<\/span> : Would you rather they hide and be scared all the time? Let them have fun Jay, they don't want to think about where the humans take us or what happens after that.<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"31929ecc-d743-4439-9707-44b8269cb87e\" data-label=\"Jay\" data-type=\"component\">Jay<\/span> : You don't understand! Dee came back yesterday, I saw her and that human that took her away up in the front! She didn't have fur anymore, her skin was all blue and she had fins, like a fish. She's a fish, Iye! The humans turned her into a fish!<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"0c850ecd-835f-45ec-902e-ac4ad1ad0256\" data-label=\"Iye\" data-type=\"component\">Iye<\/span> : Whoa\u2026 That's freaky\u2026<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"31929ecc-d743-4439-9707-44b8269cb87e\" data-label=\"Jay\" data-type=\"component\">Jay<\/span> : Yeah, and you know what Em said when I told them all what I saw?! \u201cCool!\u201d Can you believe it?!<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"0c850ecd-835f-45ec-902e-ac4ad1ad0256\" data-label=\"Iye\" data-type=\"component\">Iye<\/span> : I don't want some human to grab me and turn me into a fish\u2026 But what can we do about it? We can't stop them, can we?<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"31929ecc-d743-4439-9707-44b8269cb87e\" data-label=\"Jay\" data-type=\"component\">Jay<\/span> : I... I don't know...<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"0c850ecd-835f-45ec-902e-ac4ad1ad0256\" data-label=\"Iye\" data-type=\"component\">Iye<\/span> : We need to come up with a plan, even if it's just us, okay? Say, let's play a quick card game, that always helps me calm down and think.<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"31929ecc-d743-4439-9707-44b8269cb87e\" data-label=\"Jay\" data-type=\"component\">Jay<\/span> : Hmmm, okay. I guess it can't hurt.<\/p>",
                "type": "string"
            },
            "cType": "components",
            "cId": "e8a43519-dd88-482e-8ed1-1db1e8fd764c"
        },
        "b248a224-4f28-42b9-a28a-9fa32221bda8": {
            "name": "Text",
            "value": {
                "data": "<p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"31929ecc-d743-4439-9707-44b8269cb87e\" data-label=\"Jay\" data-type=\"component\">Jay<\/span> : This is so frustrating! Why does she keep bringing them here?!<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"0c850ecd-835f-45ec-902e-ac4ad1ad0256\" data-label=\"Iye\" data-type=\"component\">Iye<\/span> : I don't know, they should just leave us alone. We don't want to be fish or anything else!<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"31929ecc-d743-4439-9707-44b8269cb87e\" data-label=\"Jay\" data-type=\"component\">Jay<\/span> : Yeah, we're great just the way we are! We're not going to change for any dumb human!<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"0c850ecd-835f-45ec-902e-ac4ad1ad0256\" data-label=\"Iye\" data-type=\"component\">Iye<\/span> : Never, promise?<\/p><p><span class=\"mention-component mention\" data-id=\"31929ecc-d743-4439-9707-44b8269cb87e\" data-label=\"Jay\" data-type=\"component\">Jay<\/span> : Of course! Promise!<\/p>",
                "type": "string"
            },
            "cType": "components",
            "cId": "1775d40c-7d2d-427c-9f11-2220fb26b810"
        }
    },
    "exportVersion": 1,
    "name": "Helping Hand",
    "cover": null
